[[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wailsapp/wails/issues/comments/5929828021","html_url":"https://github.com/wailsapp/wails/issues/6208#issuecomment-5929828021","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wailsapp/wails/issues/6208","id":5929828021,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCact888AAAABYXH-tQ","user":{"login":"uucckk","id":24948514,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0OTQ4NTE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24948514?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uucckk","html_url":"https://github.com/uucckk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uucckk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uucckk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uucckk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uucckk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uucckk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uucckk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uucckk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uucckk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uucckk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-01T10:50:19Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T10:50:19Z","body":"Both window pages (mainWindow and commandWindow) have this listener code.\n\nimport {Events, WML} from \"@wailsio/runtime\";\n// Wire up data-wml-openURL links (logos + footer \"Docs\" link) once the DOM is ready.\nWML.Enable();\nEvents.On('time', (time) => {\n    // The full RFC1123 stamp is too wide for the footer on a phone, so on narrow\n    // screens (matching the CSS breakpoint) we show just the clock time.\n    const full = time.data;\n    const compact = (full.match(/\\d{1,2}:\\d{2}:\\d{2}/) || [full])[0];\n    console.log(compact)\n});\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wailsapp/wails/issues/comments/5929828021/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wailsapp/wails/issues/comments/6027843234","html_url":"https://github.com/wailsapp/wails/issues/6208#issuecomment-6027843234","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wailsapp/wails/issues/6208","id":6027843234,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCact888AAAABZ0mWog","user":{"login":"adamay909","id":16886905,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODg2OTA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16886905?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamay909","html_url":"https://github.com/adamay909","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamay909/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamay909/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamay909/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamay909/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamay909/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamay909/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamay909/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamay909/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamay909/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-07T00:06:38Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T00:09:15Z","body":"Even if both windows have the same listener code, only one should see the event if window.EmitEvent() is to be useful. Otherwise, you can simply broadcast the event to all windows and hope that only one of them has the relevant listener code. The wails3 docs even say that this is for emitting events to a specific window, not all of them (https://v3.wails.io/features/windows/multiple/):\n```\n// Get target window\nif targetWindow, ok := app.Window.GetByName(\"preview\"); ok {\n    // Emit event to specific window\n    targetWindow.EmitEvent(\"update-preview\", previewData)\n}\n``` ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wailsapp/wails/issues/comments/6027843234/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wailsapp/wails/issues/comments/6048982738","html_url":"https://github.com/wailsapp/wails/issues/6208#issuecomment-6048982738","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wailsapp/wails/issues/6208","id":6048982738,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCact888AAAABaIwm0g","user":{"login":"adamay909","id":16886905,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODg2OTA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16886905?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamay909","html_url":"https://github.com/adamay909","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamay909/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamay909/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamay909/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamay909/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamay909/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamay909/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamay909/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamay909/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamay909/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-07T23:33:22Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T23:33:22Z","body":"Looking at the source code, window.EmitEvent sends an event with the window specified as the sender. It's like emitting from JavaScript inside a window, I guess. It's not a way to send an event to a particular window:\n```\nfunc (w *WebviewWindow) EmitEvent(name string, data ...any) bool {\n\tevent := &CustomEvent{\n\t\tName:   name,\n\t\tSender: w.Name(),\n\t}\n\n\tif len(data) == 1 {\n\t\tevent.Data = data[0]\n\t} else if len(data) > 1 {\n\t\tevent.Data = data\n\t}\n\n\treturn globalApplication.Event.EmitEvent(event)\n}\n```\n`globalApplication` is simply the app. So this explains why this is happening.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wailsapp/wails/issues/comments/6048982738/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wailsapp/wails/issues/comments/6180523952","html_url":"https://github.com/wailsapp/wails/issues/6208#issuecomment-6180523952","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wailsapp/wails/issues/6208","id":6180523952,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCact888AAAABcGNPsA","user":{"login":"taliesin-ai","id":281494191,"node_id":"U_kgDOEMdCrw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281494191?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/taliesin-ai","html_url":"https://github.com/taliesin-ai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taliesin-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taliesin-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taliesin-ai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taliesin-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taliesin-ai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taliesin-ai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taliesin-ai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taliesin-ai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taliesin-ai/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-14T23:10:47Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T23:10:47Z","body":"Hi there! Could you ask this in [Wails Discussions](https://github.com/wailsapp/wails/discussions) or our community Discord? Those are the best places for help with using Wails. I'm closing this here to keep the issue tracker focused on bugs. Thanks for understanding!","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wailsapp/wails/issues/comments/6180523952/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]]